WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:14.805
The bus zoomed toward the flagpole.

2
00:00:16.006 --> 00:00:17.227
Ben gritted his teeth.

3
00:00:17.527 --> 00:00:20.970
But just before the bus reached the steel pole, it stopped.

4
00:00:23.412 --> 00:00:24.693
Waldo wiped his brow.

5
00:00:24.713 --> 00:00:27.235
"Whew!" Mr.

6
00:00:27.295 --> 00:00:28.836
Freaky raced over to the bus.

7
00:00:30.516 --> 00:00:31.997
"Is everyone okay?"

8
00:00:32.017 --> 00:00:35.420
"We're fine," Mayor Hubbletree snapped.

9
00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.142
"But you said this place was safe!"

10
00:00:39.043 --> 00:00:42.466
Mr. Freaky wrung his hands and then wiped sweat from his brow.

11
00:00:42.486 --> 00:00:45.909
"Dave!" Jen cried.

12
00:00:45.929 --> 00:00:47.350
"You came!"

13
00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:51.633
Ben saw Dave climb off the bus and head straight to Jen.

14
00:00:51.653 --> 00:00:55.816
"Yep, I'm here," Dave said with a grin.

15
00:00:55.837 --> 00:00:58.118
"I'm sorry I haven't been in touch with you.

16
00:00:58.459 --> 00:00:59.780
I lost my phone the other day."

17
00:01:00.776 --> 00:01:01.697
"That's okay!"

18
00:01:02.157 --> 00:01:03.537
Jen smiled widely.

19
00:01:04.478 --> 00:01:09.641
After everyone had climbed off the bus, the chaperones walked around, inspecting the pavement.

20
00:01:10.381 --> 00:01:12.242
Dave's mother suddenly gasped.

21
00:01:12.802 --> 00:01:15.224
"This is why we nearly crashed!"

22
00:01:15.824 --> 00:01:17.985
She pointed to a small hole in the pavement.

23
00:01:18.005 --> 00:01:21.267
"An enormous and dangerous sinkhole!"

24
00:01:22.107 --> 00:01:23.868
Mr. Freaky blew his noses.

25
00:01:23.888 --> 00:01:30.372
"Our custodian is out this week," he said nervously.

26
00:01:31.244 --> 00:01:38.107
"We've been doing our best to keep up with repairs, but a few things "Hmm," Ben thought, looking

27
00:01:38.167 --> 00:01:39.608
at the flat tire on the bus.

28
00:01:41.088 --> 00:01:45.510
He floated over for a better look and saw quickly that his suspicions were right.

29
00:01:45.530 --> 00:01:48.371
"Mr. Freaky?"

30
00:01:49.252 --> 00:01:50.612
He waved over the principal.

31
00:01:50.632 --> 00:01:53.954
"I don't think the accident is our fault.

32
00:01:54.954 --> 00:01:58.055
That tire is totally bald—it has no treads left."

33
00:01:58.075 --> 00:02:01.028
"What?" Dave's mother cried.

34
00:02:01.608 --> 00:02:06.310
The adults ran over to look at the tire, and so did the safety patrol officers.

35
00:02:17.273 --> 00:02:19.313
Mog crossed his arms over his chest.

36
00:02:19.333 --> 00:02:20.514
"Ben's right.

37
00:02:20.854 --> 00:02:22.594
That tire's in bad shape.

38
00:02:22.894 --> 00:02:26.795
It probably wouldn't have gone flat from the sinkhole if it had been a safe tire."

39
00:02:27.576 --> 00:02:28.396
Jen snorted.

40
00:02:29.548 --> 00:02:32.550
"This is a clear violation of Section 99-B."

41
00:02:33.211 --> 00:02:35.552
Mr. Freaky nodded enthusiastically.

42
00:02:35.572 --> 00:02:38.294
"Absolutely! Section 99-B.

43
00:02:38.694 --> 00:02:40.576
That's exactly what I was thinking."

44
00:02:41.176 --> 00:02:43.157
Waldo spun toward Mayor Hubbletree.

45
00:02:43.177 --> 00:02:46.560
"Didn't anyone inspect the school bus before the students got into it?"

46
00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:48.921
"Yes." Mr.

47
00:02:48.981 --> 00:02:50.222
Freaky stood up straight.

48
00:02:50.242 --> 00:02:54.505
"This bus should have been carefully inspected, Mayor Hubbletree."

49
00:02:55.486 --> 00:02:57.307
The mayor's face turned bright red.

50
00:02:59.168 --> 00:03:00.929
"I—I—I'm not sure," he stuttered.

51
00:03:00.949 --> 00:03:05.673
"We'll have to discuss school bus safety procedures when we get back to People Place."

52
00:03:06.393 --> 00:03:12.898
He glanced nervously at the three parent chaperones, who were huddled together, whispering and shooting angry looks at

53
00:03:12.958 --> 00:03:19.523
him. "Well, people, it'll be a lot safer inside our school building than on that bus," Mr.

54
00:03:19.583 --> 00:03:20.743
Freaky said gleefully.

55
00:03:20.763 --> 00:03:26.828
"Let me take you to the gym, where everyone will be spending the night.

56
00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:29.701
Does anyone need to borrow a sleeping bag?"

57
00:03:29.721 --> 00:03:32.401
"I have an extra coffin!"

58
00:03:32.781 --> 00:03:33.842
a vampire called.

59
00:03:33.862 --> 00:03:38.603
"I can share my vat of toxic sludge," a green monster said.

60
00:03:39.203 --> 00:03:41.404
The humans gave him a confused look.

61
00:03:42.284 --> 00:03:43.384
The monster shrugged.

62
00:03:43.404 --> 00:03:45.665
"That's what I sleep in."

63
00:03:46.645 --> 00:03:49.386
"Um, we're good," a girl said quickly.

64
00:03:49.406 --> 00:03:51.067
"We all brought sleeping bags."

65
00:03:51.087 --> 00:03:54.748
"Great, then follow me," Mr.

66
00:03:54.808 --> 00:03:55.488
Freaky said.

67
00:03:56.092 --> 00:03:57.793
Everyone marched into the building.

68
00:04:02.954 --> 00:04:05.235
patrol officers, follow me," Mr.

69
00:04:05.295 --> 00:04:06.015
Gwarg ordered.

70
00:04:06.035 --> 00:04:08.496
"I'd like to talk to you for a few minutes."

71
00:04:09.216 --> 00:04:11.136
Mayor Hubbletree had also halted.

72
00:04:11.156 --> 00:04:17.598
"While you take the students to the gym, Freaky, the parents and I are going to check on

73
00:04:17.618 --> 00:04:19.579
a few things in your building."

74
00:04:19.599 --> 00:04:21.879
"What?" Mr.

75
00:04:21.939 --> 00:04:23.200
Freaky said in surprise.

76
00:04:23.756 --> 00:04:26.357
"You just inspected our entire building!"

77
00:04:26.377 --> 00:04:31.418
"I want to inspect the industrial arts classroom to make sure things are safe," Mr.

78
00:04:31.458 --> 00:04:32.058
Chin said.

79
00:04:32.078 --> 00:04:34.919
"We weren't able to see it the other day, remember?

80
00:04:35.259 --> 00:04:36.360
Is it open tonight?"

81
00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:42.401
"Well, yes, but—" "And I'll be taking another look at the science lab," Mrs.

82
00:04:42.441 --> 00:04:43.001
Grump said.

83
00:04:43.021 --> 00:04:46.722
"That seems like a very dangerous place."

84
00:04:46.742 --> 00:04:48.963
"I'm sure everything is fine," Mr.

85
00:04:49.003 --> 00:04:49.643
Freaky said.

86
00:04:49.663 --> 00:04:52.104
"This is not necessary at all."

87
00:04:53.156 --> 00:04:56.598
"I'm going to do another kitchen inspection," Dave's mom said.

88
00:04:56.618 --> 00:04:59.659
"I want to see what snacks are being served."

89
00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.561
"Oh brother," Ben thought.

90
00:05:04.581 --> 00:05:06.962
"How much inspecting do these parents need to do?"

91
00:05:07.542 --> 00:05:10.183
But Winnie did her best to smile politely at Mrs.

92
00:05:10.243 --> 00:05:15.666
Grump. "As a member of the welcome committee, I'd be happy to escort you to the science lab,

93
00:05:15.686 --> 00:05:16.286
Mrs. Grump."

94
00:05:17.046 --> 00:05:20.608
Ben took a deep breath and tried to match Winnie's patient tone.

95
00:05:23.412 --> 00:05:24.913
"Mr. Chin, thank you for coming.

96
00:05:25.333 --> 00:05:27.534
I can bring you to the industrial arts classroom.

97
00:05:28.754 --> 00:05:31.776
And, Cleo, can you please show the kitchen to Dave's mom?"

98
00:05:31.796 --> 00:05:35.377
"Sure!" Cleo said with a friendly smile.

99
00:05:35.397 --> 00:05:39.059
"Follow me, Mrs.

100
00:05:39.119 --> 00:05:42.780
Wharton. The cafeteria is right around the corner."

101
00:05:46.322 --> 00:05:48.023
Mr. Freaky flapped his arms.

102
00:05:48.043 --> 00:05:50.964
"Everyone else, follow me to the gym!"

103
00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:56.101
"Right this way to the industrial arts classroom!"

104
00:05:56.301 --> 00:05:58.242
Ben said as they walked down the hallway.

105
00:05:58.262 --> 00:06:01.624
"As you can see, our school is in terrific shape."

106
00:06:03.865 --> 00:06:08.247
But just as they arrived at the classroom's door, the fire alarm began to clang.

107
00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:14.731
monsters shouted.

108
00:06:14.751 --> 00:06:17.492
"Get out of the building right now!"
